01:20:25.130 --> 01:20:28.790
I understood it all too well.

01:20:32.330 --> 01:20:38.210
Ikikau hitobito mizutamari ni utsuru
People coming and going are reflected in puddles

01:20:38.580 --> 01:20:44.210
Boyaketa shingou akairo no mama de
The blurred traffic light stays red

01:20:44.420 --> 01:20:50.540
Gairotou no speaker, kowareta you ni
The streetlamp's speaker, as if it's broken

01:20:50.540 --> 01:20:57.380
Uso bakari nandomo utatteru
Is singing nothing but lies over and over

01:20:57.880 --> 01:21:04.170
Samishisou na emi mo amai kokyuu mo
A lonely smile and also a sweet breath

01:21:04.170 --> 01:21:10.750
Tooi me no oku ni himeta omoi mo
As well as feelings hidden behind distant eyes

01:21:11.080 --> 01:21:19.210
Madobe o shitataru shizuku no you de
Like drops that trickle down the window

01:21:21.880 --> 01:21:28.460
Kono sora ga nakiyandeshimaeba kimi wa
If this sky stops singing, then you

01:21:28.460 --> 01:21:33.920
Kaerubeki basho e tobitatteshimau no darou
Will likely fly off to the place you are meant to return to

01:21:33.920 --> 01:21:40.880
Kimi to kono mama torikago no naka de eien
With you like this inside a birdcage forever

01:21:40.880 --> 01:21:46.080
Tojikomerarete, tobenai mama de
Confined, remaining unable fly

01:21:46.080 --> 01:21:49.080
Madoromi no naka
In a light slumber

01:21:53.920 --> 01:21:59.790
Yorisou koibito, hidamari no kasa o
Lovers who snuggle close, a parasol for a sunny spot

01:22:00.000 --> 01:22:05.500
Wakeau sugata, boku wa me o tojiru
The sight of them sharing it. I close my eyes

01:22:06.130 --> 01:22:12.210
Matataita winker sekasareru you ni
As if I'm rushed by a blinking turn signal

01:22:12.210 --> 01:22:17.790
Moyagakaru michi o eranda yoru
The night I chose a misty road

01:22:17.790 --> 01:22:24.290
Senaka awase no mama kasaneta toki mo
All the time we spent with our backs to each other

01:22:24.290 --> 01:22:30.880
Kuchi ni fukundeiru yasashii uso mo
As well as the white lies held inside your mouth

01:22:31.250 --> 01:22:39.250
Yume bakari o tada uzukaseru dake
It just makes my dreams ache

01:22:41.880 --> 01:22:48.540
Kono koe o kuchi ni shiteshimaeba kimi o
If I speak with this voice, then

01:22:48.540 --> 01:22:53.790
Nurashiteru ame wa furiyandeshimau no darou
The rain that is soaking you will likely stop falling

01:22:53.790 --> 01:23:00.880
Kimi to kono mama torikago no naka de eien
With you like this inside a birdcage forever

01:23:00.880 --> 01:23:06.750
Tojikomerarete, tobenai mama de
Confined, remaining unable fly

01:23:32.830 --> 01:23:43.670
Amaoto ni kakurete futari, hisoyaka na saezuri o
The two of us hide behind the sound
of the rain, surreptitiously twittering

01:23:45.130 --> 01:23:55.670
Mado no soto mitsumenaide, kokoro koko ni oite
Don't stare out the window. Keep your mind here

01:23:55.790 --> 01:24:02.380
Kono sora ga nakiyandeshimaeba kimi wa
If this sky stops singing, then you

01:24:02.380 --> 01:24:07.710
Kaerubeki basho e tobitatteshimau no darou
Will likely fly off to the place you are meant to return to

01:24:07.710 --> 01:24:14.630
Kimi to kono mama torikago no naka de eien
With you like this inside a birdcage forever

01:24:14.630 --> 01:24:20.420
Tojikomerarete, tobenai mama de
Confined, remaining unable fly

01:24:20.420 --> 01:24:27.080
Ima wa tada egakenai asu mo
The tomorrow we're unable to simply paint now

01:24:27.080 --> 01:24:32.290
Modorenai kako mo, futari me o tojite
As well as the past we can't return to. We both close our eyes

01:24:32.290 --> 01:24:39.170
Kimi to kono mama torikago no naka de eien
With you like this inside a birdcage forever

01:24:39.170 --> 01:24:44.580
Tojikomerarete, sekai ni futari dake
Confined, just the two of us in the world

01:24:44.580 --> 01:24:47.540
Motomeau mama
As we seek each other

01:24:50.750 --> 01:24:55.960
Torikago no naka
Inside a birdcage

01:24:56.830 --> 01:24:59.880
Madoromi no naka
In a light slumber
